WEBVTT

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:03.700
The Kokuboro have
attacked yet again.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.900
Yoshimori, Masamori,
and the Night Troops

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:10.000
engage in fierce battle

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:13.700
against them at Karasumori
in the dead of night.

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:20.020
During the battle,

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:22.280
Yoshimori chased after what
he thought was Kaguro,

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:25.010
but that was a trap laid
by the Kokuboro.

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:30.280
Shion was sent to capture
the Kekkaishi.

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:42.840
Back at Karasumori,
Sakon has taken Atora hostage

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:47.400
and demands that
Masamori give up Karasumori.

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:58.750
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:00.620
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:05.830
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:07.730
(Fighting late into the night)

00:01:08.230 --> 00:01:11.170
Drive away all hesitation

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:15.570
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:19.110
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:01:19.110 --> 00:01:22.440
I will protect you, that's all
(that's all I want)

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:28.110
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:32.610
Sha la la la la...

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:39.030
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:41.000
(Secret romance)

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:46.200
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:47.960
(A strange distance)

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:54.810
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:55.880
Yeah

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:59.350
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:02.950
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:02:02.950 --> 00:02:08.290
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:33.000
What are you going to do now?

00:02:33.950 --> 00:02:34.940
Shall I?

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:39.590
It's too dangerous.
I can't predict his moves.

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:45.690
That's right. You better not try
any funny business.

00:02:45.960 --> 00:02:49.900
Chief! Don't mind me!
Get him!

00:02:50.130 --> 00:02:52.760
Not many people can say
what you just said.

00:02:52.800 --> 00:02:53.820
Well done.

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:57.230
Let go of Hanashima.

00:02:57.610 --> 00:03:02.670
Do you understand the situation?
The hostage is in my hands.

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:05.670
You will all retreat
from Karasumori.

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:09.940
Or would you prefer to suffer
a beautiful casualty?

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:24.260
Yaichi...

00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:29.470
Come on. Please stay still.

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:34.200
Let me go!

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:37.980
I can't do that. Please behave.

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:39.380
Or else I will-

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:44.510
Big Sister!

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:45.540
Yaichi!

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:47.910
I suggest that you
shouldn't play petty tricks.

00:03:48.460 --> 00:03:50.230
Also, I should thank you.

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:55.320
Thanks to you I was able to fully
absorb Karasumori's power.

00:04:11.110 --> 00:04:12.840
I've come pretty far.

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:15.350
The Black Pampas Grass that
Grandma was talking about...

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:16.440
Could it be around here?

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:01.520
Ketsu!

00:05:12.740 --> 00:05:15.710
Is that the Kokuboro's castle?

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:18.710
It's a lot bigger than I thought.

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:23.250
What was that?

00:05:26.890 --> 00:05:28.410
Something feels strange.

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:31.190
It feels like the entire dimension
is warping!

00:05:31.690 --> 00:05:32.680
I better hurry!

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:39.890
That idiot... where is he?

00:06:18.340 --> 00:06:22.540
This is it! This is the power
that I have long sought!

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:24.510
The power of Karasumori!

00:06:26.050 --> 00:06:28.880
Now hand this place over to me.

00:06:29.020 --> 00:06:32.140
Then I will show you hell,

00:06:32.190 --> 00:06:36.090
incomparable to what
the Kokuboro weaklings can do!

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:39.860
Is that all you have to say?

00:06:41.060 --> 00:06:43.930
I should say the same to you!

00:06:45.870 --> 00:06:49.360
The bigger the enemy,
the larger the target.

00:06:49.770 --> 00:06:50.430
Ketsu!

00:06:58.610 --> 00:06:59.600
Chief!

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:01.980
Well, to be honest...

00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:05.980
I was thinking about how I could
do it without hurting Hanashima.

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:07.720
You fool!

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:11.030
I don't need a hostage now that
I have the power of Karasumori!

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:12.720
Behold!

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:15.120
You don't understand anything.

00:07:16.230 --> 00:07:18.630
You've already lost.

00:07:36.480 --> 00:07:37.470
What?!

00:07:41.320 --> 00:07:46.120
So this... is the Kekkai technique...

00:07:54.940 --> 00:07:56.340
Are you all right, Hanashima?

00:07:56.700 --> 00:07:59.570
Chief! I-I'm so sorry!

00:08:00.510 --> 00:08:01.600
I'm glad you're all right.

00:08:02.140 --> 00:08:03.130
Now, then.

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:06.750
I wonder what the rest of you
are going to do?

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:08.820
Sakon-san was defeated.

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:10.150
It's over.

00:08:10.220 --> 00:08:11.210
Let's get out of here.

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:30.430
The enemy's main forces
are still intact.

00:08:31.140 --> 00:08:33.200
We should regroup
and plan out a strategy.

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:36.200
Support team!
Confirm all personnel!

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:38.540
Medics! Transport the wounded
to the Yukimura household!

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:41.310
The rest of you stay here
and be on guard!

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:42.180
Yes, sir!

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:44.980
Now then, where's Yoshimori?

00:08:45.220 --> 00:08:46.580
Deputy Chief!

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:50.490
What's wrong?
Did something happen?

00:08:50.690 --> 00:08:53.820
Sen-chan has disappeared!

00:08:54.030 --> 00:08:54.690
What?

00:09:01.940 --> 00:09:03.430
Sen-chan!

00:09:05.340 --> 00:09:07.270
That's Sen-chan's?

00:09:09.710 --> 00:09:12.410
Grandpa, Madarao is back.

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:14.000
Madarao?!

00:09:14.980 --> 00:09:17.510
Madarao! Is Karasumori safe?!

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:22.480
Well, it seems that
Karasumori itself is fine.

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:26.350
But Yoshimori was taken away
by the Kokuboro.

00:09:26.530 --> 00:09:27.890
What did you say?

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:41.030
It looks so much bigger up close.

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:45.970
I better prepare myself. I doubt
I can find him right away.

00:10:01.960 --> 00:10:03.660
How is it going, Shion?

00:10:03.860 --> 00:10:04.850
Not good.

00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:06.800
I tried plenty of times,
but he keeps bouncing it back.

00:10:07.070 --> 00:10:09.000
What's with his aura?

00:10:09.640 --> 00:10:12.730
Don't you have any other way
to suppress his powers, Hekian?

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:15.370
I can't turn him into
a puppet like this.

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:19.080
I have to rewrap him with
new threads periodically

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:20.380
or he'll break free.

00:10:21.150 --> 00:10:23.580
Tell me, will he really be useful

00:10:23.580 --> 00:10:26.710
in maintaining
this run down castle?

00:10:26.950 --> 00:10:31.820
I believe so. At least,
he has the ability to do so.

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:33.990
He is a Kekkaishi, after all.

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:39.300
We tend to get distracted by
the techniques they cast...

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:41.320
but Kekkaishi can create
dimensional space,

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:43.130
stabilize it, and fortify it.

00:10:43.770 --> 00:10:49.770
They can also repair damaged space.
These are their true abilities.

00:10:50.680 --> 00:10:55.840
Right now, the buildings are not
the only things crumbling here.

00:10:55.980 --> 00:10:59.890
The dimensional space itself
is beginning to deteriorate.

00:11:00.620 --> 00:11:02.850
If we can manipulate this kid,

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:05.290
we may repair
this dimensional space.

00:11:05.730 --> 00:11:07.290
The fact that he's withstood
your attacks this long,

00:11:07.290 --> 00:11:08.780
just proves how strong he is.

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:11.490
He'll make a decent test subject.

00:11:11.800 --> 00:11:14.860
But how did you manage
to catch him?

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:17.300
You can't even touch him right now.

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:19.200
Well... yeah...

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:24.240
I can't tell them that
he came on his own.

00:11:26.480 --> 00:11:28.280
It doesn't seem to
be progressing well.

00:11:28.550 --> 00:11:29.950
Not exactly.

00:11:32.990 --> 00:11:36.650
A black suit?
But he's not wearing human skin.

00:11:37.560 --> 00:11:39.890
He looks and feels completely
different from Kaguro.

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:43.260
He's more...
I don't know how to explain it...

00:11:45.670 --> 00:11:47.760
Are you the boss here?

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:49.800
No.

00:11:49.940 --> 00:11:52.430
Nevermind, then. Bring Kaguro here.

00:11:53.740 --> 00:11:56.440
You are currently our prisoner.

00:11:57.140 --> 00:12:00.580
I'd prefer that you speak in a way
that befits your current position.

00:12:01.550 --> 00:12:02.540
Bring him here!

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:11.510
Kagemiya!

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:16.990
That's a Half-Ayakashi that
you brought to fill your quota.

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:20.100
What? He's not a Kekkaishi?

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:21.400
I didn't know that!

00:12:21.770 --> 00:12:24.140
Kagemiya, why are you here?!

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:26.740
Good. Looks like they
know each other.

00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:34.650
Wait! He has nothing
to do with this!

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:35.550
Let him go!

00:12:35.550 --> 00:12:37.950
Like I said. Know your place.

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:40.740
We are the ones making the demands.

00:12:42.590 --> 00:12:46.290
You just do as you are told.

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:49.960
As a loyal servant...

00:12:54.070 --> 00:12:55.540
Don't worry.

00:12:55.740 --> 00:12:58.200
I will allow some of
your consciousness to remain.

00:12:58.910 --> 00:13:02.310
If I don't do that, you won't
be able to use your powers.

00:13:04.280 --> 00:13:06.840
It seems that you still intend
to resist.

00:13:08.780 --> 00:13:09.770
Are you all right with that?

00:13:10.750 --> 00:13:14.380
You may lose another person
right in front of your eyes.

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:33.730
This is bad!

00:13:43.980 --> 00:13:45.880
Don't mess with me!

00:13:52.490 --> 00:13:53.480
That's-

00:13:55.160 --> 00:13:56.750
Byaku-san, this is bad.

00:13:57.060 --> 00:14:01.360
If he resists too strongly,
he could destroy the entire castle.

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:05.800
Seems we brought in
something very troublesome.

00:14:07.940 --> 00:14:11.340
Shion. Wear him
down little by little.

00:14:11.810 --> 00:14:12.470
Huh?

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:15.740
And throw the other kid
in the dungeon.

00:14:16.320 --> 00:14:17.940
Hey, wait!

00:14:20.190 --> 00:14:22.890
Have Aihi create a device
that can efficiently extract

00:14:22.890 --> 00:14:24.690
the powers of the Kekkaishi.

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:27.350
Are you giving up on
inserting a worm?

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:30.260
He's a kid.

00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:32.130
Even if I tamed him,

00:14:32.130 --> 00:14:35.360
he probably can't fully control
his own powers.

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:40.160
What's the matter, Grandfather?

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:44.940
Masamori! It seems that fool
Yoshimori has done it again!

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:46.440
What did he do?

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:49.540
He willingly had himself
captured by the Kokuboro!

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:50.870
What?!

00:14:54.920 --> 00:14:55.580
Yes?

00:14:55.760 --> 00:14:57.720
Hatori, gather everyone
that can still fight!

00:14:58.060 --> 00:15:00.250
We are heading to
the Black Pampas Grass right now!

00:15:02.760 --> 00:15:03.750
That idiot!

00:15:08.740 --> 00:15:11.710
Is the Kekkaishi
we captured going to be useful?

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:15.930
He seems powerful,
but difficult to control.

00:15:16.410 --> 00:15:19.400
You'll have to control him
by force, Hekian-kun.

00:15:19.880 --> 00:15:21.580
The castle is in ruins.

00:15:22.380 --> 00:15:24.820
It doesn't seem that bad.

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:28.310
You just don't know how this castle
was in its prime.

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:33.420
Just a while ago, everything about
this castle was perfect.

00:15:33.730 --> 00:15:35.920
A while ago? When was that?

00:15:36.230 --> 00:15:37.820
About 300 years ago.

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:38.620
Uh...

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:41.390
At the time I started
serving our princess,

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:44.530
it was so beautiful...

00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:46.560
Koshu-san?

00:15:47.140 --> 00:15:51.810
Anyway, I think we should reduce
the size of Kokuboro.

00:15:51.980 --> 00:15:55.280
We will preserve the central areas
and cut off anything unnecessary.

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:59.110
According to my calculations,
it could last 200 more years.

00:15:59.450 --> 00:16:02.650
It wasn't this big
in the first place.

00:16:03.360 --> 00:16:08.120
It started expanding rapidly
after Byaku came.

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:11.760
And that forced expansion
is now taking its toll.

00:16:19.510 --> 00:16:21.940
Okay. Do it slowly.

00:16:31.020 --> 00:16:33.680
You idiots!
That's why I said "slowly"!

00:16:35.790 --> 00:16:36.920
Don't make me repeat myself!

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:39.690
We have to exhaust him
little by little!

00:16:39.960 --> 00:16:41.060
If we do it all at once,

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:44.620
he might release his powers
all at once and escape!

00:16:51.210 --> 00:16:52.470
Hey you...

00:16:52.910 --> 00:16:55.470
This is becoming a pain,
so give in.

00:16:55.940 --> 00:16:58.970
We're just asking you to
fix up the castle a little.

00:16:59.380 --> 00:17:00.780
Get Kaguro!

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:04.410
That again? You're persistent.

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:08.980
You know, I like this castle.

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:13.460
I probably wouldn't have joined
the Kokuboro

00:17:13.460 --> 00:17:15.020
if it weren't for the castle.

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:17.660
It would be a tragedy if
this place crumbled away.

00:17:17.660 --> 00:17:18.760
Don't you think?

00:17:23.470 --> 00:17:25.960
Stay focused, or you'll be crushed!

00:17:26.870 --> 00:17:27.860
Damn it!

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:30.240
I don't have time for this!

00:17:56.570 --> 00:18:02.070
That's odd, Kagami-kun.
I thought this was the keep.

00:18:02.140 --> 00:18:04.540
It is, Professor.
No mistake about it.

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:09.110
I assumed that he
would be here, but...

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:10.140
Oh?

00:18:10.180 --> 00:18:14.380
By chance, are you Yoshimori-kun?

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:17.190
Who are you?

00:18:17.190 --> 00:18:18.180
Hey!

00:18:18.590 --> 00:18:20.820
You're still alive?!

00:18:21.060 --> 00:18:23.000
I knew something wasn't right!

00:18:24.670 --> 00:18:26.260
That feeling...

00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:29.830
Would you like to kill me again?

00:18:30.970 --> 00:18:32.960
No way.
It's not worth the bother.

00:18:35.940 --> 00:18:37.410
Kagami-kun.

00:18:37.440 --> 00:18:38.100
Yes.

00:18:47.050 --> 00:18:49.080
That thing with the geezer...

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:51.160
That thing is dangerous.

00:18:51.990 --> 00:18:54.050
It's a creature from another dimension,
different from ours...

00:18:56.100 --> 00:18:57.090
I should go...

00:19:05.570 --> 00:19:11.700
Now, then. Seeing how you are here
in the keep...

00:19:12.010 --> 00:19:15.150
I'm guessing that
you're a poor little sacrifice,

00:19:15.150 --> 00:19:18.740
brought to this crumbling castle
for your Kekkaishi powers.

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:22.990
Is that right, Yoshimori-kun?

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:25.350
Like I said, who are you?

00:19:26.490 --> 00:19:32.060
Matsudo Heisuke. Well, that name
belongs to a dead man.

00:19:32.200 --> 00:19:33.190
Matsudo?

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:37.330
Oh! You're friends with
Grandpa Shige and Dad!

00:19:37.700 --> 00:19:41.770
I can't bear to leave the grandson
of an old friend here.

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:44.910
It may be extra work for me,

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:51.370
but I can relieve you from
those restraints, if you wish.

00:19:53.490 --> 00:19:57.510
I have such a strong sense
of duty sometimes.

00:19:57.960 --> 00:20:01.290
However, you must leave
this place at once.

00:20:01.460 --> 00:20:03.190
That's the condition.

00:20:04.030 --> 00:20:07.520
No thanks.
I'll do it myself.

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:10.230
I have something I have to do here.

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:11.630
Something to do?

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:14.630
There's someone I have to defeat.

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:17.440
Oh? Who is that?

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:19.480
That's none of your business.

00:20:27.650 --> 00:20:28.750
Who is it?

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:30.720
Say it.

00:20:30.990 --> 00:20:35.950
Depending on who it is,
I may have to restrain you more.

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:39.460
Kaguro.

00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:43.400
Kaguro. The black one.

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:47.310
So it's not the white one.

00:20:47.440 --> 00:20:51.040
I don't care if it's
not the white one.

00:20:52.210 --> 00:20:55.310
Very well! I will change
the condition.

00:20:57.220 --> 00:21:01.850
My target is the white one.
Do not attack him.

00:21:02.520 --> 00:21:05.750
I'm planning the performance
of a lifetime.

00:21:06.260 --> 00:21:08.630
I will not allow
an audience, either.

00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:13.360
My target is white,
while yours is black.

00:21:13.400 --> 00:21:16.270
Let's make a pact
of non-aggression.

00:21:16.840 --> 00:21:17.830
Non-aggression?

00:21:17.870 --> 00:21:20.970
That means we will not infringe
upon each other's territory.

00:21:21.070 --> 00:21:25.910
If you agree to this pact,
I will free you of that load.

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:28.240
What are you?

00:21:28.350 --> 00:21:30.840
Don't be inquisitive.

00:21:31.820 --> 00:21:35.690
I only want a simple answer,
Yoshimori-kun.

00:21:35.990 --> 00:21:38.010
Do you want to be free?

00:21:38.330 --> 00:21:39.720
Or not?

00:21:41.530 --> 00:21:43.790
What's with that old man Matsudo?

00:21:44.830 --> 00:21:45.830
Stop!

00:21:45.830 --> 00:21:47.060
Catch him!

00:21:58.850 --> 00:22:02.050
For starters, shall
we destroy the castle

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:04.040
as we move through it, Kagami-kun?

00:22:04.320 --> 00:22:05.480
Yes, Professor.

00:22:09.590 --> 00:22:10.260
What?!

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:11.920
The castle!

00:22:13.760 --> 00:22:14.750
Just you wait!

00:22:15.060 --> 00:22:16.050
Kaguro!

00:22:45.960 --> 00:22:51.490
10 minute break,
I wanna do so much

00:22:53.370 --> 00:22:59.400
Class is over, but someone
in the front asks a question

00:22:59.770 --> 00:23:01.930
"What nerve"

00:23:02.340 --> 00:23:05.310
I'm at ease as long as
I have a mirror

00:23:05.350 --> 00:23:09.040
"Make up's on right,
my eyes look all right"

00:23:09.080 --> 00:23:15.420
See, if you look behind you,
there's a girl who curled her hair

00:23:15.760 --> 00:23:20.460
I hate studying,
I like P.E. okay

00:23:20.490 --> 00:23:22.390
Basketball, volleyball,
and tennis, what?

00:23:22.430 --> 00:23:27.660
You're not gonna make me
run long distance today, teacher!

00:23:27.700 --> 00:23:31.190
My face will get oily,
and I hate being sore

00:23:31.240 --> 00:23:35.300
I'm that kind of
a beautiful high school girl

00:23:49.790 --> 00:24:00.130
10 minute break, I'll get busy
drawing a map of the future
